#[chapter/09/lore]{
  notes: [
    "Nine honks are discrete signal relics — collectible without being gamified into compulsion."
    "The ninth was never sounded. Its shard is the egg: the kernel of a call that chose heat instead of air."
    "Scattering forces community: no single keeper can hold the whole call."
  ]
}

